    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002501</IRI>
        <Literal>p is causally related to q if and only if p or any part of p and q or any part of q are linked by a chain of events where each event pair is one where the execution of p influences the execution of q. p may be upstream, downstream, part of, or a container of q.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117"/>
        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002501</IRI>
        <IRI>https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165</IRI>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
