        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/definition"/>
        <IRI>http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma5022</IRI>
        <Literal>Nonparenchymatous organ that primarily consists of skeletal muscle tissue aggregated into macroscopic fasciculi by connective tissue; together with other muscles, it constitutes the muscular system. Examples: biceps, diaphragm, masseter, right third external intercostal muscle, external oblique, levator ani, serratus anterior.</Literal>
